1
00:00:05,205 --> 00:00:07,115
(Sheldon:)-Come in.

2
00:00:09,143 --> 00:00:10,953
(Leonard:)Hey, you got a second?

3
00:00:11,111 --> 00:00:13,421
(Sheldon:)Yes. Actually, I'm glad you're here.

4
00:00:13,581 --> 00:00:16,491
(Sheldon:)I'm working on
the Star Wars Day schedule.

5
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:20,260
(Sheldon:)Now, I have a window built in
after Phantom Menace,

6
00:00:20,421 --> 00:00:22,331
(Sheldon:)for complaining, but...

7
00:00:24,425 --> 00:00:27,165
(Sheldon:)...I'm worried an hour
won't be enough time.

8
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:32,610
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I've got some bad news.

9
00:00:33,334 --> 00:00:34,474
(Sheldon:)What is it?

10
00:00:35,469 --> 00:00:39,509
(Leonard:)I just read online that
Arthur Jeffries passed away.

11
00:00:41,842 --> 00:00:43,622
(Sheldon:)Professor Proton is dead?

12
00:00:44,812 --> 00:00:46,522
(Leonard:)Sorry, buddy.

13
00:00:56,957 --> 00:00:58,867
(Sheldon:)What are you doing?

14
00:00:59,927 --> 00:01:02,027
(Leonard:)Comforting you?

